-- NorthstarIQ — The governed lifecycle evidence chain, end to end
--
-- ⚠️ NEW REPRODUCIBILITY ARTIFACT — created 2026-08-27 after the SQL
-- qualification foundation was implemented, for repeatable verification. It is
-- NOT evidence that this query was used during original validation, and it is
-- not historical evidence of anything.
--
-- Purpose: answer the four lifecycle questions from one row, in order.
--
--   MQL_Basis__c              why Marketing qualified it
--   Sales_Accepted_By__c/_At__c/_Basis__c
--                             who accepted responsibility, when, under which policy
--   Qualified_Need__c / Next_Step_Date__c / SQL_Basis__c
--                             what Sales established with the prospect
--   IsConverted / ConvertedDate / Converted*Id
--                             what Salesforce actually did
--
-- Each stage is written once by Lead_Inbound_Before_Save and never afterwards,
-- so a converted Lead still carries all four. Verified 2026-08-27: every field
-- below survived a native Lead Conversion intact.
--
-- ⚠️ A NOTE FOR THE FUTURE DETECTIVE CONTROL. Next_Step_Date__c was required to
-- be TODAY OR LATER at the moment of qualification. It will naturally fall into
-- the past as time passes, so a historical integrity check must NOT flag
-- `Next_Step_Date__c < TODAY`. It must judge the date against the recorded
-- qualification event — SQL_Basis__c carries the date as it stood, and Lead
-- Status field history carries when SQL was entered.
--
-- Expected on 2026-08-27 against the loaded fixture set: 0 rows. No baseline
-- Lead has ever been through the governed lifecycle, and nothing was
-- retroactively qualified — which is the correct prospective result.
--
-- Read-only. Safe to run against any org.

SELECT Id,
       Name,
       Company,
       Status,
       Lifecycle_Stage_Entered__c,
       MQL_Basis__c,
       Sales_Accepted_At__c,
       Sales_Accepted_By__c,
       Sales_Acceptance_Basis__c,
       Qualified_Need__c,
       Next_Step_Date__c,
       Next_Step__c,
       SQL_Basis__c,
       IsConverted,
       ConvertedDate,
       ConvertedAccountId,
       ConvertedContactId,
       ConvertedOpportunityId
FROM Lead
WHERE MQL_Basis__c != null
   OR Sales_Accepted_At__c != null
   OR SQL_Basis__c != null
ORDER BY Lifecycle_Stage_Entered__c DESC
